meta {
  name: dashboard
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}reports/dashboard/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~days: 30
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Dashboard tiles (FR-9.3). Any role: total components (non-archived), total
  stock value (quantity x last buying price), low-stock count (in stock but at
  or below minimum), out-of-stock count, pending requisitions, drawer
  utilisation, the 10 most recent movements (Staff see only their own), and
  the 5 most consumed components (net takes minus returns) over the last
  `days` days (default 30, max 365).


  ## API example response
  {
    "total_components": 8,
    "total_stock_value": "22048.00",
    "low_stock_count": 3,
    "out_of_stock_count": 2,
    "pending_requisitions": 0,
    "drawer_utilisation": {
      "total_chambers": 14,
      "in_use": 7,
      "empty": 7,
      "utilisation_percent": 50.0
    },
    "recent_movements": [
      {
